	abstract = {The proceeding contains 68 papers. The topics discussed include: using weak bisimulation for enterprise integration architecture formal verification; design and description of a classification system framework for easier reuse; patterns for integrating and exploiting some non-functional properties in hierarchical software components; component-based system integration via(Meta)model composition; modern distributed data acquisition and control systems based on OPC techniques; node-oriented modeling and simulation of IP networks; transformation of existing programs into automatic and self-healing entities; methods of sensors localization in wireless sensor networks; adaptive misbehavior detection in wireless sensors network based on local community agreement; design of a wireless sensor network based automatic light controller in theater arts; end-user development framework for embedded system applications; and diagnosis of embedded software using program spectra.},
